Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Jacobi triple product:
 prod(1-q^{2n})(1+q^{2n-1}z)(1+q^{2n-1}/z) = sum q^{k^2} z^k

Pins the master identity and its three classical children:
 (a) Euler pentagonal: prod(1-q^n) = sum (-1)^k q^{k(3k-1)/2}
 (b) Triangular theta at z = q
 (c) Jacobi four-squares: theta_3^4 = 1 + 8 sum_{d|n, 4 nmid d} d * q^n

Verified symbolically over Q[z, z^{-1}][[q]] to q^25 and |k| <= 5.
All four specialisations close; r_4(n) matches theta_3^4 coefficients exactly.

